<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kakehiki wa nai sa sou dayo</font></b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">that's right, there's no compromise</font></b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">yoru wo nukeru</font></b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">we'll slip through the night</font></b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">nejikomu sa saigo ni</font></b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">at the final moment push hard</font></b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">sashihiki zero sa sou dayo</font></b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">that's right, all the way to zero</font></b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hibi wo kezuru</font></b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">until we wipe away the days</font></b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kokoro wo sotto</font></b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">gently open your heart</font></b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hiraite gyutto</font></b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hiki yosetara</font></b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you pull it close to you</font></b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">todoku yo kitto</font></b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">it will reach you, without a doubt</font></b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">tsutau yo motto sa aa</font></b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">it will come, closer, now</font></b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">iki isoide shiboritotte</font></b></font></font></font>

25
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">we're speeding through life, squeezing it for all of its worth</font></b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">motsureru ashi</font></b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">our feet are tied</font></b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakedo mae yori zutto sou tooku he</font></b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">but we still keep going further</font></b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">ubaitotte tsukandatte</font></b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">even if I take it back, and grasp it</font></b></font></font></font>

32
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kimi janai nara</font></b></font></font></font>

33
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you're not the one</font></b></font></font></font>

34
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Special technique!</font>

39
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu, fishing version!</font>

40
00:02:12,070 --> 00:02:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thrash about more!</font>

41
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to catch some for curing!</font>

42
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three isn't enough!</font>

43
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three more, useless!</font>

44
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is very taxing, you know?!</font>

45
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, let's switch!</font>

46
00:02:26,550 --> 00:02:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

47
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fire's ready to light!
Fireballs please.</font>

48
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess three is okay for the time being...</font>

49
00:02:36,170 --> 00:02:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

50
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait a minute!</font>

51
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Absolutely No Peeking!</font>

52
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Secret of the Scroll</font>

53
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already been four days
since the second exam started.</font>

54
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

55
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

56
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The start of the second exam
was around three in the afternoon.</font>

57
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We only have twenty-five or
twenty-six hours left.</font>

58
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:05,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There may already be
some teams that have passed.</font>

59
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...</font>

60
00:03:09,580 --> 00:03:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if it'll be broiled soon.</font>

61
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're soon going to be in a hot spot...</font>

62
00:03:18,050 --> 00:03:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the biggest one.</font>

63
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

64
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:27,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we were to try pursuit,</font>

65
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's probably hardly anybody left
to become targets.</font>

66
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do we do?</font>

67
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost everyone's surely already passed.</font>

68
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. It's already been
four days, after all.</font>

69
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway...</font>

70
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's early afternoon now...</font>

71
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's have a meal.</font>

72
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two rest a bit and
I'll go find us something to eat.</font>

73
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:03,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

74
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:04,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

75
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, on the other one...</font>

76
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Heaven" was written here...</font>

77
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:15,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and unlike this,
both edges of the scroll were whitish, right?</font>

78
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, when I was shown
the scroll before the exam,</font>

79
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't really looking.</font>

80
00:04:22,030 --> 00:04:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what of it all of a sudden?</font>

81
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You've got to be kidding...?</font>

82
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For all we know...</font>

83
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there may not be any Heaven scrolls.</font>

84
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean, Sakura?</font>

85
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, in this second exam...</font>

86
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">four of the five-day
time limit have passed already.</font>

87
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that means we've already
used eighty percent of the total exam time.</font>

88
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seventy-eight participants
and twenty-six teams.</font>

89
00:05:04,030 --> 00:05:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are only thirteen each
of the Heaven and Earth scrolls.</font>

90
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At most there are only
thirteen passing teams.</font>

91
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, you remember,
don't you, Sasuke-kun?</font>

92
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That the Orochimaru guy burned
the "Heaven scroll" that we had.</font>

93
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means...</font>

94
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The teams that will pass had already,
at that point, decreased by one.</font>

95
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

96
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, all of the other scrolls are
not necessarily safe, so...</font>

97
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After parting ways with
the Leaf Village bunch,</font>

98
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we allotted two days for healing...</font>

99
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So from here on, we have to increase
the distance of our actions.</font>

100
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate,
the next enemy is our last chance.</font>

101
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get some drinking water.</font>

102
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!</font>

103
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a good way for us not to fight
with an enemy.</font>

104
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

105
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get serious!</font>

106
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am serious.</font>

107
00:06:26,570 --> 00:06:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have lots of scrolls stocked, so.</font>

108
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninjutsu manual, deadly poison manual,
for notes...</font>

109
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we tweak this a little and change it
into exactly like the Heaven scroll...</font>

110
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hold it!</font>

111
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:39,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

112
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you did such a thing,
you don't know what's written on the inside!</font>

113
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the Proctor looked inside
you will be discovered right away!</font>

114
00:06:46,130 --> 00:06:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

115
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Generally with things like this,</font>

116
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a password or
something written</font>

117
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you can't get it
unless you have both scrolls.</font>

118
00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words...</font>

119
00:06:56,600 --> 00:07:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to pass at the tower goal,
we'll surely need a password.</font>

120
00:07:00,230 --> 00:07:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or something like that.</font>

121
00:07:02,650 --> 00:07:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What difference does it make?</font>

122
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't know the content,
there's no use making a fake!</font>

123
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, here I was wondering what
you were going to say, looking all big...</font>

124
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an idiot who just can't
think through things.</font>

125
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:20,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

126
00:07:21,210 --> 00:07:23,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if we could predict the content...?</font>

127
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Earth scroll...</font>

128
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wouldn't...</font>

129
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to... open this scroll!</font>

130
00:07:32,930 --> 00:07:33,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

131
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Have you forgotten
even the rules, you idiot?</font>

132
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were told not to look inside the scrolls
until arriving at the tower, right?</font>

133
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, at this rate,
we'll be in a hot spot, right?</font>

134
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There might be a trap or something.</font>

135
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Carefully... Be careful.</font>

136
00:08:25,770 --> 00:08:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

137
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

138
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:37,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's wrong?</font>

139
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

140
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:47,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

141
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?!</font>

142
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

143
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!
Answer me!</font>

144
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'd best not do it.</font>

145
00:10:44,410 --> 00:10:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An enemy?</font>

146
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, you're beyond saving...</font>

147
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close.</font>

148
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-We're sorry.</font>

149
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who ignored the rules are forced
into the situation of having to retire.</font>

150
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the previous exam, hypnotism
Jutsu Formula was set up to</font>

151
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">get into the eyes of those who looked
at the scroll along the way.</font>

152
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A measure to get them to lie
in the forest until the end of the exam.</font>

153
00:11:21,450 --> 00:11:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way...</font>

154
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I'm not mistaken, you're Kabuto, right?</font>

155
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing hanging
around here alone?</font>

156
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that I'm after your scroll.</font>

157
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think so.</font>

158
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that was your intention...
you could've taken it from Naruto just now.</font>

159
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're also after the Heaven scroll?</font>

160
00:11:41,930 --> 00:11:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

161
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already have them both.</font>

162
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See?</font>

163
00:11:47,310 --> 00:11:48,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

164
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things led to things...</font>

165
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was hurrying over to
the vicinity of the tower</font>

166
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to wait for my estranged companions.</font>

167
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, if you'll excuse me...</font>

168
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

169
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight me.</font>

170
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky!</font>

171
00:12:14,210 --> 00:12:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight you, you say?</font>

172
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke-kun.</font>

173
00:12:17,210 --> 00:12:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This dumb-suke.</font>

174
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying suddenly?</font>

175
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you serious?</font>

176
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but we don't have anymore time.</font>

177
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:30,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sasuke!
Kabuto-san saved us!</font>

178
00:12:31,350 --> 00:12:34,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, I don't know about that, myself.</font>

179
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:35,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

180
00:12:36,810 --> 00:12:38,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

181
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.
I said it before, too.</font>

182
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is all that can be done
to survive through this forest now.</font>

183
00:12:46,490 --> 00:12:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... That's a lie.</font>

184
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lie?</font>

185
00:12:52,750 --> 00:12:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your heart isn't totally in this
as much as you're saying.</font>

186
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you could really become
serious about this exam...</font>

187
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it necessary to fight me?</font>

188
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should jump on me
at my unguarded moment,</font>

189
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without going to
the trouble of announcing it.</font>

190
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... a Ninja.</font>

191
00:13:17,810 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, that's profound.</font>

192
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't dislike that side of you.</font>

193
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I shall tell you the way you should go.</font>

194
00:13:30,370 --> 00:13:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... let's talk as we move.</font>

195
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smell of broiled fish in the fire smoke
had reached a great distance.</font>

196
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, we'll be marked
by fierce animals... and enemies.</font>

197
00:13:48,050 --> 00:13:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

198
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are there really still enemies around?</font>

199
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, no mistake.</font>

200
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you think about it a little,
you'll understand.</font>

201
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know the cleverest way
of fighting in battles</font>

202
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in jungles and
expansive forests such as this?</font>

203
00:14:10,370 --> 00:14:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

204
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tower located in the center
of this forest,</font>

205
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:15,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the common goal for us test-takers.</font>

206
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means when the last day
of the test is here...</font>

207
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the area near that tower is
the easiest place to gather scrolls.</font>

208
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see.
Ambush, right?</font>

209
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, we go after the scrolls
of the teams</font>

210
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:33,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that have both the Heaven and Earth scrolls
and are setting out for the tower.</font>

211
00:14:34,810 --> 00:14:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's one-third of the answer.</font>

212
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:37,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

213
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean that you guys are
not the only ones thinking that!</font>

214
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Near the tower, the same badgers
have probably already set traps, so...</font>

215
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

216
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means there are lots of enemies
lying in wait to engage us.</font>

217
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:54,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, having a handicap
gets me pumped!</font>

218
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm looking forward to it!</font>

219
00:14:56,540 --> 00:14:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we just beat them all and
get the Heaven scroll,</font>

220
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll all survive the second exam!</font>

221
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! This is still two-thirds of the answer!</font>

222
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the remaining
one-third of the answer?</font>

223
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The collectors who are certain
to appear during an exam of this nature.</font>

224
00:15:11,590 --> 00:15:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Collectors?</font>

225
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this exam, with the tower
just a stone's throw away,</font>

226
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you definitely can't rest easy...</font>

227
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those particular conditions
are what create them.</font>

228
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:25,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
those who gather extra scrolls...</font>

229
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:30,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as compensation for sparing them
when coming across an unexpected enemy.</font>

230
00:15:31,570 --> 00:15:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, those who get information to
proceed favorably through later exams</font>

231
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by providing the lacking scrolls to
comrades sharing the same village.</font>

232
00:15:41,170 --> 00:15:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And those who are thinking of,
under conditions favorable to them,</font>

233
00:15:45,170 --> 00:15:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">annihilating the powerful ones who
will probably get through to the third exam.</font>

234
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:53,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It goes without saying,
but these guys are quite the big guns</font>

235
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the worst enemies who
are definitely not conceited.</font>

236
00:15:57,970 --> 00:15:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

237
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand the reason
why you appeared before us.</font>

238
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're scared, too, right?</font>

239
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:08,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

240
00:16:16,990 --> 00:16:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, the tower has finally
come into view.</font>

241
00:16:20,330 --> 00:16:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on is the hard part.</font>

242
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's go!</font>

243
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An enemy already?</font>

244
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

245
00:16:39,810 --> 00:16:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's just a centipede.</font>

246
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes! It's huge.</font>

247
00:16:44,310 --> 00:16:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All those legs are gross.</font>

248
00:16:47,610 --> 00:16:48,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun.</font>

249
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

250
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to avoid inadvertent sounds and
careless actions from here on.</font>

251
00:16:54,070 --> 00:16:54,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

252
00:16:55,110 --> 00:16:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rushing ahead through a dense forest
making noise like an elephant</font>

253
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the same as serving notice
in a loud voice that we're coming.</font>

254
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'd definitely receive
an enthusiastic welcome.</font>

255
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Oh, I see.</font>

256
00:17:09,750 --> 00:17:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as time allows, we should
go slowly while remaining hidden.</font>

257
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:15,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah.
— Okay.</font>

258
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:16,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure.</font>

259
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, not bad, everyone.</font>

260
00:17:37,910 --> 00:17:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

261
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, it's this way.</font>

262
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it a trap?</font>

263
00:18:13,230 --> 00:18:16,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. It'll get intense ahead from here on.</font>

264
00:18:36,170 --> 00:18:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto nii-chan!</font>

265
00:18:40,930 --> 00:18:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Huh?</font>

266
00:18:42,350 --> 00:18:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close, Naruto-kun.</font>

267
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substitution Jutsu!</font>

268
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:52,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you, it would get intense ahead
from here on.</font>

269
00:18:59,910 --> 00:19:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've... had it...</font>

270
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:03,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sakura-chan!</font>

271
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For crying out loud,
how far have we walked?</font>

272
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tower hasn't gotten a bit closer.</font>

273
00:19:11,210 --> 00:19:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we can see it right
in front of our eyes.</font>

274
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strange...</font>

275
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:16,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake about it.</font>

276
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that we're already
within the enthusiastic welcome.</font>

277
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a look at that.</font>

278
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:28,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that can't be!</font>

279
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What on earth is going on?</font>

280
00:19:34,610 --> 00:19:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

281
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Genjutsu...?</font>

282
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems.</font>

283
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were lured in perfectly.</font>

284
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:44,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears we were
meticulously careful,</font>

285
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and were made to walk around
the same place in a circle.</font>

286
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:50,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're being watched...</font>

287
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably.</font>

288
00:19:52,790 --> 00:19:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They intend to wear down
our physical strength and</font>

289
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">catch us unprepared
when we're bone-tired.</font>

290
00:19:57,590 --> 00:20:00,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, then this follows the enemy strategy.</font>

291
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... they'll be coming soon.</font>

292
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've appeared.</font>

293
00:20:50,850 --> 00:20:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah!</font>

294
00:20:52,730 --> 00:20:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the perfect handicap.</font>

295
00:21:05,100 --> 00:21:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

296
00:21:05,100 --> 00:21:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

297
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

